{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ee5feaf8-5db6-84b6-8626-1e19242d0096",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:44:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosa Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:40:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:40:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Rosa Castillo. I am calling about a deck. I want to make a deck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good afternoon, Ms. Castillo. A deck on your own house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I am the landlord. The house is two-seventeen Spring Street. It is a rental house, I am the owner. I want a deck off the back. Small one, for the tenants."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Two-seventeen Spring. So what's your question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:40:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to know, does the deck need a permit? And after, an inspection? Somebody comes to look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:41:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes to both. A new deck attached to a house usually needs a building permit, and there are inspections while it's built and when it's done. Footings especially."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Footings. Sorry, I do not know this word. Please, what is footings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The concrete down in the ground that the posts sit on. The inspector looks at those before you cover them up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. The concrete under the post. Yes. So first the permit, then the inspector comes to the concrete, then at the end again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the usual order. Permit first, before any work starts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:41:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before the work. Okay. Another question. Must a licensed contractor apply? Or I can apply, because I am the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:41:55-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Owners can often pull a permit for their own property, but it depends on the work and whether you live there. Since it's a rental and you may not live in the house, I'd want the building official to confirm that for you. A contractor can definitely apply on your behalf."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:42:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, maybe I can, maybe I cannot. Is this right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. It depends on your situation. Do you live in the house yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I live in Middletown. The tenants live in the house. Two families, one up, one down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then I'd lean toward hiring a licensed contractor, and the building official can tell you for sure. Let me take your number and have somebody call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:42:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:42:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-five. Got it. Anything else you need to know before they call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, one moment. [pause] Sorry. My granddaughter, she is here with me, and she tells me about the school. A book fair. They ask twenty dollars for books. I am listening to her and I am calling you, so I am a little mixed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Sounds like a busy afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Okay, I am back. So, I need the permit for the deck, the inspector for the concrete and the end. And maybe a contractor must apply. I say it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Permit, inspections, and the contractor question is what the building official will confirm when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And I should not start building now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Don't start anything until the permit's issued."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Not start. I will wait for the call. Thank you, Mister Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Castillo. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:43:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
